# Repo convention: LF line endings for every text file.
#
# `text=auto` lets git detect text vs binary on add/checkout; `eol=lf` then
# forces the stored and checked-out form to LF on every platform. Windows
# checkouts will see LF in the working tree — no per-file CRLF flips, no
# noisy whitespace diffs across platforms.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary blobs — never touch line endings.
*.gz binary
